margin-bottom","first_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/a-diy-decks-are-pre-engineered.png","second_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/enjoy-your-patio-deck-today.png","second_richtext":"<h3><strong>Enjoy Your Deck Today<\/strong><\/h3><p>Your deck is ready. Set up your furniture, light the grill, invite the neighbors. Our portable patio deck kit is a quick and easy way to build your deck for your RV, campsite, or around the house.<\/p><p>A-DIY's portable patio deck kits offer the strength and beauty of contractor-grade construction with true portability. Our patent-pending modular system has an easy setup, lets you build a professional deck in under few hours, and disassemble it whenever you need to.<\/p>","second_text_class":"richtext-md h3-margin-bottom"}},"two_column_media_text_button_QNgL7U":{"type":"two-column-media-text-button","name":"Two Column Section Button","settings":{"section_heading":"Choose Your Perfect Travel Easy Deck","heading_class":"none","heading_richtext":"","heading_richtext_class":"none","section_bg_color":"#ffffff","left_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/pressure-treated-kiln-dried-wood-deck-kit-719820.jpg","left_content":"<h3><strong>Pressure-Treated Wood Deck Kits<\/strong><\/h3><h3><\/h3><p>The most affordable option delivers natural wood beauty and proven durability. Our kiln-dried, Grade 1 pressure-treated lumber resists rot, insects, and weather damage for decades of reliable performance.<\/p><p>✓ Most affordable portable deck option<\/p><p>✓ Natural wood appearance<\/p><p>✓ Proven 30+ year lifespan with minimal maintenance<\/p><p>✓ Can be stained or sealed to match your style<\/p><p>✓ Full portability and easy disassembly<\/p>","left_content_class":"Rich-Text","left_button_text":"Shop Pressure-Treated Deck Kits","left_button_link":"https:\/\/a-diy.com\/products\/pressure-treated-kiln-dried-wood-deck-kit","left_button_class":"button-secondary","right_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/a-diy-composite-deck-kit-879850.jpg","right_content":"<h3><strong>Composite Deck Kits<\/strong><\/h3><p>Premium composite decking offers the beauty of wood without the maintenance. Our composite boards resist fading, staining, scratching, and mold, comes with a 25-year warranty.<br\/><\/p><p>✓ Ultra-low maintenance (no staining, sealing, or yearly upkeep)<\/p><p>✓ Won't splinter, crack, or warp<\/p><p>✓ Fade-resistant color stays beautiful for decades<\/p><p>✓ Eco-friendly recycled materials<\/p><p>✓ Full portability and easy disassembly<\/p><p>✓ 25-year warranty<br\/><\/p>","right_content_class":"none","right_button_text":"Shop Composite Deck Kits","right_button_link":"https:\/\/a-diy.com\/products\/a-diy-composite-deck-kit","right_button_class":"button-secondary"}},"media_with_text_xKT9gm":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"video_6idETi":{"type":"video","settings":{"desktop_video":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/2-Homepage (1).mov"}},"richtext_LBExjJ":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"stars":false,"text":"","richtext_class":"text-16\/14-500","text_color":"","margin_bottom_desktop":"md:mb-3","margin_bottom_mobile":"mb-2"}},"richtext_DniyGk":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"stars":false,"text":"<h2><strong>Moving Your A-DIY Deck is Super Easy<\/strong><\/h2>","richtext_class":"richtext-md","text_color":"","margin_bottom_desktop":"md:mb-3","margin_bottom_mobile":"mb-2"}},"richtext_jQ6fUJ":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"stars":false,"text":"<p>Unlike traditional decks that require demolition to relocate, A-DIY decks disassemble in the same amount of time it takes to build. Each component is engineered for repeated assembly and disassembly without damage or wear. <\/p><p><\/p><ul><li>Average disassembly time: few hours<\/li><li>All components fit in a standard pickup truck or trailer<\/li><li>No special tools required for teardown<\/li><li>Components designed for multiple assembly cycles<\/li><li>Easy to store during off-season or moves<\/li><\/ul>","richtext_class":"richtext-md","text_color":"","margin_bottom_desktop":"md:mb-1