. Reverse the assembly steps, transport the pre-cut components, and reinstall at your new location. Customers move them for relocations, end of season, and RV site transitions.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_Ji9w8f":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>Will it level on uneven ground?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Yes. Cut your posts to the appropriate height for each footing point, or use our longer post kits. Even a moderately sloped yard can be leveled. Our design team can walk you through it on a free consultation call.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_xRCEmR":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>How strong is it? Can it hold furniture and people?<\/strong>","content":"<p>A-DIY decks use 6x6 beams and 2x8 joists at 14-inch spacing — the same specs used by professional contractors. Our decks comfortably support full outdoor furniture sets, grills, and groups of people.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_HrYWCC":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>What's included in the kit?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Your kit includes all pre-cut lumber components, galvanized screws, a drill bit, and TuffBlock footings. T